---
import BlockLayout from '../../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
import { DEVNET, assertDevnetLaunchPinned } from '../../data/chain-home';
assertDevnetLaunchPinned();
---
<BlockLayout title="Account Book · PointCast" description="Keep a local watchlist of public PointCast devnet addresses, with labels and live play balances." hideAds>
  <main class="account-book" data-account-book data-api={DEVNET.url} data-genesis={DEVNET.genesis} data-chain-id={DEVNET.chainId}>
    <nav class="book-nav" aria-label="Chain navigation"><a class="book-brand" href="/chain/">POINTCAST / CHAIN</a><div><a href="/chain/mist/">← Mist browser</a><a href="/chain/start/">Wallet setup ↗</a></div></nav>
    <header class="book-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">A companion to PointCast Mist</p><h1>Account Book<span>◎</span></h1><p class="book-lede">Keep the addresses you follow in one place.<br />Give them a name. Check their play balance.</p></div><div class="network-pill"><span class="network-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><b>PUBLIC DEVNET</b><small data-network-state>Checking identity…</small></div></div></header>
    <p class="book-notice"><strong>Play ATTN. No value is promised.</strong> One sequencer runs this public, unmoderated devnet. It may pause or reset, and balances may disappear. Saved addresses are a watchlist; they do not prove ownership or connect a wallet.</p>
    <section class="saved-book" aria-labelledby="saved-title"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / WATCH ONLY</p><h2 id="saved-title">Saved addresses <span data-count>0 / 24 saved</span></h2></div><button type="button" data-refresh>Refresh balances</button></div>
      <p class="network-status" data-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Checking chain identity…</p><button class="quiet" type="button" data-reload hidden>Reload after checking the reset notice</button>
      <div class="account-list" data-list aria-label="Saved public accounts" aria-busy="true"></div>
      <p class="fine">Balances and account existence are reported by the devnet operator; they are not independently verified here. The chain can advance between reads. This book does not reconstruct transaction history. <a href={DEVNET.yardHref}>Explore and verify blocks ↗</a></p>
    </section>
    <div class="book-tools"><section class="tool-panel" aria-labelledby="add-title"><p class="eyebrow">02 / ADD AN ADDRESS</p><h2 id="add-title">Who are you following?</h2><p class="tool-intro">Paste a public chain address. No keys, wallet connection or signature are needed.</p>
      <form data-add-form><label for="book-address">Public address</label><input id="book-address" data-address type="text" required maxlength="80" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="tz1…, tz2…, pca1… or pcp1…" aria-describedby="address-help" /><p class="field-help" id="address-help">PointCast address checksums are checked before saving.</p><label for="book-label">Local label <span>(optional · 64 characters)</span></label><input id="book-label" data-label type="text" maxlength="64" autocomplete="off" placeholder="e.g. Studio account" /><button type="submit">Save public address</button></form>
    </section><section class="tool-panel" aria-labelledby="local-title"><p class="eyebrow">03 / YOUR BROWSER</p><h2 id="local-title">Local by design</h2><p class="storage-status" data-storage></p><button type="button" class="quiet" data-reset-storage hidden>Clear unreadable local save</button><p class="tool-intro">Export a public-address backup to move your book to another browser. Labels stay local and are included in the file. Live requests send each watched address to the devnet; labels and import files are never uploaded.</p><div class="backup-actions"><button type="button" class="quiet" data-export disabled>Export book (.json)</button><label class="import-button" for="book-import">Import book (.json)<input id="book-import" data-import type="file" accept="application/json,.json" /></label></div><p class="field-help">Account Book v1 only · up to 24 addresses · 24 KiB max. Imports add new addresses and keep existing labels. Never choose a private-key backup.</p><details><summary>What’s in an export?</summary><p class="fine">A version number, the chain ID and genesis hash, and a list of public addresses with labels. Balances, keys and signatures are never saved in the book.</p></details></section></div>
    <p class="book-message" data-message role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <footer class="book-footer"><span>WATCH HERE. ACT IN THE APPS.</span><a href="/chain/start/">Open wallet setup ↗</a><a href="/chain/mist/">Back to Mist ↗</a></footer>
    <noscript><p class="book-notice">JavaScript is needed to save addresses, import or export this book, and read live balances. The chain and wallet setup links still work.</p></noscript>
  </main>
  <script is:inline type="module" src="/chain/accounts/book.js"></script>
</BlockLayout>
<style is:global>
  .account-book{--book-ink:#243431;--book-muted:#61736e;--book-line:#d6dfda;--book-green:#216b58;background:#f3f5f0;color:var(--book-ink);max-width:1500px;margin:auto;padding:clamp(20px,4vw,64px);font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}
  .account-book *{box-sizing:border-box}.account-book a{color:var(--book-green)}.account-book :is(h1,h2,h3,p){margin-top:0}.account-book .book-nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;font-size:.8rem}.account-book .book-nav>div{display:flex;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}.account-book .book-brand{font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.12em;text-decoration:none;font-size:.7rem}.account-book .book-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;align-items:end;margin:52px 0 28px}.account-book .eyebrow{font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:800;color:var(--book-green);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px}.account-book h1{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,7vw,5.4rem);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin-bottom:18px}.account-book h1 span{font-size:.6em;margin-left:18px;color:#5c9075;font-weight:400}.account-book .book-lede{font-size:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.15rem);line-height:1.6;color:var(--book-muted);margin-bottom:0}.account-book .network-pill{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:#e2ece3;border:1px solid #c9ddcf;padding:15px 19px;border-radius:8px;flex-shrink:0;font-size:.72rem}.account-book .network-pill small{display:block;color:var(--book-muted);font-size:.75rem;margin-top:5px}.account-book .network-dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--book-green)}.account-book .book-notice{background:#fcf1d9;border:1px solid #e4d2a8;border-radius:7px;padding:16px 19px;line-height:1.65;font-size:.85rem;margin-bottom:30px}.account-book .saved-book{border:1px solid var(--book-line);border-radius:10px;background:#fff;padding:clamp(18px,3vw,32px)}.account-book .section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:18px}.account-book h2{font-size:clamp(1.3rem,3vw,1.7rem);letter-spacing:-.035em;margin-bottom:0}.account-book h2 span{display:inline-block;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:0;font-weight:550;color:var(--book-muted);margin-left:12px}.account-book button,.account-book .import-button{border:1px solid var(--book-green);border-radius:5px;background:var(--book-green);color:#fff;min-height:44px;padding:10px 15px;font:inherit;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:720;cursor:pointer;line-height:1.4}.account-book button:hover,.account-book .import-button:hover{background:#164e3f}.account-book button:disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.55}.account-book button.quiet{background:#f6f9f5;border-color:#c8d7cb;color:var(--book-green)}.account-book button.quiet:hover{background:#e7f0e8}.account-book [hidden]{display:none!important}.account-book :is(a,button,input,summary):focus-visible,.account-book .import-button:focus-within{outline:3px solid #d8933f;outline-offset:3px}.account-book .network-status{font-size:.79rem;line-height:1.55;color:var(--book-muted);margin:16px 0}.account-book .account-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.account-book .book-empty{grid-column:1/-1;text-align:center;padding:35px 20px 27px;border:1px dashed #c6d6ca;background:#f8faf6;border-radius:6px}.account-book .empty-mark{font-size:2.8rem;color:#6f9c7a;display:block;margin-bottom:12px}.account-book .book-empty h3{font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:9px}.account-book .book-empty p{max-width:460px;margin:0 auto;color:var(--book-muted);font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65}.account-book .account-card{min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--book-line);background:#fbfcf9;border-radius:7px;padding:18px}.account-book .card-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:19px}.account-book .account-kind{color:var(--book-green);font-weight:800}.account-book .watch-tag{color:var(--book-muted)}.account-book .account-card h3{font-size:1.15rem;letter-spacing:-.025em;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin-bottom:7px}.account-book .public-address{display:block;font-size:.73rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--book-muted);overflow-wrap:anywhere;user-select:all}.account-book .balance{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;margin:22px 0 7px}.account-book .balance strong{font-size:1.8rem;letter-spacing:-.04em;overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0}.account-book .balance span{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--book-muted);white-space:nowrap}.account-book .account-state{font-size:.74rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--book-muted);min-height:2.6em}.account-book .label-form{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:end;border-top:1px solid var(--book-line);padding-top:16px;margin-top:16px}.account-book .label-form label{min-width:0;flex:1}.account-book .label-form button{padding:9px;font-size:.72rem;flex-shrink:0}.account-book label{display:block;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:7px}.account-book .label-form label{margin-bottom:0;font-size:.68rem}.account-book input[type=text]{display:block;background:white;border:1px solid #bbcdbf;border-radius:5px;padding:11px 12px;min-height:44px;width:100%;font:inherit;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--book-ink)}.account-book .label-form input{margin-top:6px;font-size:.78rem;padding:9px}.account-book .card-actions{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-top:13px}.account-book .card-actions button{font-size:.71rem;padding:8px 10px}.account-book button.remove{background:transparent;color:#836655;border-color:transparent;text-decoration:underline}.account-book .fine{font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--book-muted);margin:20px 0 0}.account-book .book-tools{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:24px}.account-book .tool-panel{min-width:0;padding:clamp(19px,3vw,30px);border:1px solid var(--book-line);border-radius:8px;background:#f9faf6}.account-book .tool-intro,.account-book .storage-status{font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--book-muted);margin:14px 0 20px}.account-book .storage-status[data-warning=true]{color:#865625;background:#fff0d5;padding:12px;border-radius:5px}.account-book .field-help{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--book-muted);line-height:1.6;margin:8px 0 17px}.account-book form>label span{font-weight:400;color:var(--book-muted)}.account-book form>button{margin-top:17px}.account-book .backup-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;align-items:center}.account-book .import-button{position:relative;margin:0;background:#fff;color:var(--book-green);border-color:#c8d7cb}.account-book .import-button:hover{background:#e7f0e8}.account-book .import-button input{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;width:100%;height:100%;cursor:pointer}.account-book details{border-top:1px solid var(--book-line);padding-top:13px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--book-muted)}.account-book summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:32px}.account-book details p.fine{margin-top:8px}.account-book .book-message{position:sticky;bottom:12px;z-index:2;background:#e2eee5;border:1px solid #a8c6b0;box-shadow:0 3px 15px #203e2210;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.55;margin:20px 0 0}.account-book .book-message:empty{display:none}.account-book .book-footer{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;margin-top:30px;font-size:.73rem}.account-book .book-footer span{color:var(--book-muted);letter-spacing:.08em;margin-right:auto;font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800}
  @media(max-width:1050px){.account-book .account-list{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:700px){.account-book .book-header{display:block;margin-top:36px}.account-book .network-pill{display:inline-flex;margin-top:22px}.account-book .book-tools{grid-template-columns:1fr}.account-book .book-nav{align-items:start}.account-book .book-nav>div{display:grid;gap:10px;text-align:right}.account-book .section-head{align-items:start;flex-wrap:wrap}.account-book h2 span{display:block;margin:7px 0 0}.account-book .section-head button{font-size:.75rem}.account-book .account-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}.account-book .book-message{bottom:8px}.account-book .book-footer{gap:14px}.account-book .book-footer span{width:100%}}
</style>
